  <p class="eyebrow">Consulting</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">Digital Transformation Strategy</h1>
  <p class="prose-content">Aligns technology investments with business goals, operating model, and the customer, employee, and partner journeys that define how your organisation runs.</p>
  <a href="/contact.html" class="btn-primary">Book a Strategy Session</a>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
  <div class="prose-content">
    <h2 class="section-title">The Problem and Our Approach</h2>
    <p>The core problem is that technology investments are decided by vendor preference or internal politics, not by a clear line to business outcomes. Without a structured approach, budgets are spent on tools that never deliver measurable value. This creates fragmented systems and frustrated teams.</p>
    <p>Our approach begins with assessing current digital maturity across people, process, and platform. We then define the target operating model, prioritise use cases by value and feasibility, and build a phased roadmap with measurable checkpoints. The result is a transformation programme your teams can actually execute.</p>
    <p>Outcomes you receive: a maturity assessment, target operating model, prioritised use-case backlog, and a phased implementation roadmap. Each deliverable is designed to be picked up by internal teams or implemented with our support.</p>
  </div>
</section>

