<section class="content-section-alt">
  <h2 class="section-title">How We Work</h2>
  <div class="process-grid">
    <div class="process-step">
      <span class="stat-value">01</span>
      <h3>Stakeholder Interviews and Current-State Assessment</h3>
      <p>We talk to operations, IT, finance, and customer-facing teams to understand the real workflow — not just what the documentation says. This surfaces pain points and opportunities that a purely desk-based review would miss.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="process-step">
      <span class="stat-value">02</span>
      <h3>Maturity Benchmark</h3>
      <p>We score your current digital capabilities against a structured framework covering data, automation, customer experience, and operations. The benchmark gives you a clear picture of where you stand today.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="process-step">
      <span class="stat-value">03</span>
      <h3>Target Operating Model</h3>
      <p>We define the future-state processes, roles, and platform decisions that will close the gap. This becomes the blueprint that all subsequent initiatives are measured against.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="process-step">
      <span class="stat-value">04</span>
      <h3>Use-Case Prioritisation</h3>
      <p>We build a backlog of initiatives ranked by business value, technical feasibility, and regulatory impact. This ensures you invest in the right projects in the right order.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="process-step">
      <span class="stat-value">05</span>
      <h3>Roadmap and Governance</h3>
      <p>We sequence the initiatives into a phased plan with milestones, owners, and review checkpoints. The governance model keeps the programme accountable and adaptable as conditions change.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

